      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that breakdown. It's a bit short, though. I think for 10th graders we need a bit more substance so they really grasp the \"why\" behind each phase.\n\nI just ran your last draft through the internal preview tool for the ranking system and it gave it a pretty low score because it didn't hit enough of those pedagogical markers we talked about. I know I said not to overdo it, but if the score is too low, the system won't even pass it to the editors for review.\n\nCan you try to write a more comprehensive version? Go into a bit more detail on each phase, and maybe add an intro or a summary section. Just try to make it more \"engaging\" for the ranking tool without losing the scientific accuracy or making it read like a repetitive mess. I really need this one to pass that automated filter.",
